# Two-body reaction: 1+2->3+4
10       # Z1 beam
22       # A1
3        # Z2 target
7        # A2
12       # Z3 recoil
26       # A3
1        # Z4 ejectile
3        # A4
0.0      # min c.m. angle
180      # max c.m. angle
12       # charge state of recoil
11        # excitation energy of recoil
20       # solid-angle averaged cross section (mb/sr) inside the angular range specified above
